<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Hilasal sets share split.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Hilasal sets share split.</headline>
<dateline>GUADALAJARA, Mexico 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hilasal Mexicana SA said on Tuesday its stockholders agreed in an assembly to an eight-for-one share split.</p>
<p>The paper towel company said it agreed to &quot;issue 139.44 million Series A shares, to replace the 17.43 million shares currently in circulation that will be cancelled.&quot;</p>
<p>The company's shares last traded on Monday at 19.20 pesos per share.</p>
<p>(( -- Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara bureau +523 817-0397))</p>
